{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_quartz_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_quartz_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "无需遗憾",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_quartz_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f3d5432259d3edd0f795f741f88c376c7d63a4a9a23e60eb993405162d153d9a",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维，你在后面跟紧我，不要被人群撞倒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再坚持一下，等到了安全的地方我就给你处理伤口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唔......镇长那个混蛋，简直是疯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "商店里那么多人，他居然也敢放火，根本不在乎大家是死是活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怪不得你每次提到他，都说他是个恶棍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没错，他和他手下的那些佣兵都是一群恶棍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大家平常都躲着他们，可还是会莫名其妙地被找上门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们走这边，这边人少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸欸，小姑娘，你先站住，跑什么跑？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今天的零钱呢？嗯？有吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂，大叔你还真是......这个时候还不忘找我要钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你还坐在这里，等下镇长的人就过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我一老头要啥没啥，我怕什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们两个才是，害怕什么呢？跑这么急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "惹麻烦的也不是你们，不然能让你们跑这么远？跑什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维，我们走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呼——终于到家了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维，让我看下你的伤口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（还好伤得不深，先简单处理一下，把血止住。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "除了腿上，你还有其他地方受伤了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......我没事，就是有点喘不上气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那个混蛋......太可恶了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真希望有一天能有人狠狠地教训他一顿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊，爸爸！我们回来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我听说出了乱子，结果你们两个偏偏这个时候不见了踪影，急死人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎么还受了伤，怎么搞的？你们到底干什么去了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "镇长发现有人背着他进私货，不仅把人打了，还放火烧了那人的店铺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我和艾维当时就在店里，跑出来的时候，艾维意外受了伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "镇长......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不是提醒过你们两个，最近不要出门，老老实实在家待着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我只是......想买个礼物送给石英姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她马上要走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要解释，你就回答我，我是不是说过，这几天老实待在家里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......爸爸你说过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你自己说，错了没有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大婶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "行了，艾维都受伤了，你还在凶她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大婶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维，快过来让我看看，伤得严重不严重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "妈妈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我没什么事，你看！而且石英姐姐一直在护着我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大婶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？那你得好好谢谢石英姐姐，但是你更得听你爸的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "石英姐姐，谢谢你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我该道歉才是，毕竟这次出门，也是因为我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "皮克特大叔，对不起，给你们添麻烦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉......算了，也是多亏你在旁边，艾维才没出什么大事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大婶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "石英，你明天就要走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大婶",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你爱吃什么？晚上我给你做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "石英姐姐......你不能留下来吗？我不想你离开......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "爸爸，可以让石英姐姐留在我们家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哪怕只有明天，再多一天，好不好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小艾维，以后我一定会回来看你的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "皮克特大叔，这些日子谢谢你们的照顾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "麻烦了你们这么久，我也是时候出发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哼，你别谢我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "实话说，我还巴不得你赶紧走呢。艾维每天跟着你，我都担心她会学坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "真不知道你父母怎么会同意你一个人跑到这危险的荒野上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他们啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的母亲应该也会想从家里出来到处看看吧，不过......从来没有机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我的父亲肯定不会同意，他和大叔你一样，经常念叨着外面有多么危险，虽然他也没有说错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你知道还一个人跑出来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里的人，上一秒能在那些传教的黎博利面前痛哭流涕，痛斥自己做过的那些糟糕的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可一扭头，就能为了手里的一杯啤酒，桌子上的一把赌局，家里的一头瘤兽而闹得你死我活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "最近镇子周围也经常有补给的车队和拓荒队被流匪袭击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "镇长自己就是个恶棍，警察局的老文森更是派不上用场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这里什么事情都有可能发生，也随时都有可能发生。到时候更不会有人来帮你，明白吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你要是没别的什么事情，早点回家吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "行了，也不知道现在几点，估计也不早了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "九点，对面商店的人每天差不多这个时候关门，我刚刚听到他们搬东西的声音了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？哦......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那你抓紧收拾完行李就休息吧，我还得去给那个老混蛋送货......真是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明天注意安全，早点回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "九点了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "按照以往的时间，的确该休息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不想睡觉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是也不知道该做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（那是父亲修理屋顶时的声音。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这下应该没问题了，你妈妈晚上也可以好好休息了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "石英！你在干什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "认真点，仔细看我是怎么弄的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些事情你以后都要开始学着做，知道吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（那是上门讨债的恶徒敲门的声音。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "滚出去！谁允许你们上我们家来的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欠的钱我自然会还，但是你们谁要是敢上门来找麻烦，我决不跟你们客气！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "石英，看到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你以后也要保护好你妈妈，不管是谁都不要怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不可能永远挡在你的前面，更不会有别人来帮你，一切都要靠你自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "该死！窗户外面这么亮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "今天居然起得这么晚，太不应该了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我还得......还得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（不对，是有人在敲门的声音。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谁？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父亲？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "石英！醒醒，快起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
