    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "周围的邻居都可以作证，我们一家都在家里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "家里除了我和我妻子，就只有这两个小女孩，怎么可能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "喂！快过来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "看我在这家人屋里找到了什么？！好沉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵B",
