    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "爸爸，镇长怎么把所有人都叫到这里来了啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他又想做什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们两个跟紧我，不要走散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我不明白，为什么所有人都这么怕他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "明明我们人数这么多。把他赶跑不行吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维，算爸爸求你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我求你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "听话行吗？我不想你有个三长两短。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们一家人在一起，一定会没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你相信爸爸，好不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "光抓到凶手没有用，既然有一个人敢对我动手，那一定就会有第二个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "说明我还是对某些人太宽容了，他们开始动歪心思了，这是不能容忍的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "再说抓到人又怎么样？我伤又没好，气也没有消。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要我们做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把这次接受调查的那几家的人，连着那两家敢背着我进货的商人一起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把他们都关起来，谁不老实就塞到拓荒队去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不过每家得留一个人在镇子上，这样就不怕其他人会趁机逃跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "镇长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要他们有软肋，就一定会听话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "爸爸！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "混蛋！你们要做什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们又不是感染者，凭什么要被送到拓荒队去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "要么你留在镇子上，你女儿和你老婆被送过去；要么你女儿留下，你和你老婆去拓荒队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "听明白了吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "爸爸......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "能不能......我自己去拓荒队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "让我女儿和我妻子留下，求你们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "没得商量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只能留一个人在镇子上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们！你们太过分了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "踩点的时候被发现，所以就揍了镇长一顿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们是流匪吧？最近镇子周围的几次袭击都是你们做的，现在盯上了这个镇子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "流匪，通缉犯，罪犯......随便你怎么称呼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们只是一群被逼上绝路的普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "而且我们盯上的不是镇子，而是这个镇长，以及像他一样的那些人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "镇子上的其他人呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "闹出这么大的事情，很多人都会受此牵连，还有那些无辜的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "欸......你怎么也跟他们一样婆婆妈妈的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我们只是要找上面的人讨个说法，又不是要当那种惩恶扬善的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这些人懦弱，他们胆小，他们事不关己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他们咎由自取。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "顾虑、担心、害怕，做什么都想那么多的话，那就干脆什么都别做了，这样最安全了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这样的人也最听话了，不是吗？有顾虑，不敢去做，所以这里的人都怕那个镇长。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可我不怕他，我一个老乞丐无家无业的，我怕什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他骂我骂得那么难听，我肯定揍他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "除非他杀了我，可他打不过我，所以我还是要揍他，可惜被他跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "他打不过我，所以只能拿你们这些人撒气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你想想，难道不是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你因为恪守规则而无法动弹，而那些无法无天的人，却可以随意踩在你的头上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以，又有何妨呢？怕什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就算是做一个“坏人”，又怎么样呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你说话真不像一个乞丐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可我却被迫成了一名乞丐，而你现在也成了流浪者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那如果我选择不加入你们呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "随时可以离开，继续你的旅途，我当然不会勉强你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我送你出去，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维！你干什么！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "把你手上的武器放下！你别伤到自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "小姑娘，你最好听你爸爸的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "伤到自己不要紧，想想你的爸爸妈妈，想想他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "想想你要跟我们动手的话，他们的下场是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谁也不愿意发生太难看的事情，对吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维，你不要干傻事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "只要我们一家人在一起，一切都会解决的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是，我们一家人不会再在一起了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不管谁去拓荒队，谁留在镇上，一家人终究是要分开的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "谁又知道接下来会发生什么呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我想通了，这样下去无论如何是不会有什么好结果的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "所以最坏又能怎样呢？你们要杀了我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那爸爸，如果我死了，你会替我报仇吗？你还会有所顾虑吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "皮克特大叔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维！你说什么胡话呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你们不是要动手吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "来啊！来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可恶！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "给我去死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "石英姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾维",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "*哥伦比亚俚语*！你是怎么跑出来的？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "文森那个混蛋在哪里！他想不想活了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要去找了，我会把你们都解决掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然后把镇长那个混蛋也揪出来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵A&佣兵B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你在看什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是那个女孩吧，你把她当成妹妹的那个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "艾维，她是个勇敢的女孩，还有皮克特大叔，他们其实不是坏人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "虽然我并不想承认，但如果换作是我，回到多年以前，恐怕也会做和他们一样的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "因为害怕惹恼了某些人而伤害到我的父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "因为害怕没钱给母亲治病，而努力遵守时间，努力工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "直到失去一切都不知道自己哪里做错了。明明自己做了一切他们要求做的事情，明明自己做了一切对的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "懊悔、沮丧，甚至开始责怪那个让自己有所顾虑的人，觉得如果不是因为他，自己一定会有勇气去做不一样的选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你现在还有弥补遗憾的机会，和我们一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老乞丐",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "这一切本就不是你的错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，是我错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在看到艾维的时候，我突然明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我其实可以做截然不同的选择，我其实只是在为曾经的胆小懦弱不断找借口而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "其实......有人牵挂，是一件多么值得珍惜的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "就像皮克特大叔有他心爱的女儿，文森爷爷有他的小孙女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "石英",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可耻的懦弱，但绝不是可悲的。"
    },
    {
